TITLE:: FxChainGUI
summary:: a chain of effects in a window of its own
categories:: Libraries>ParaEQ
related:: Classes/FxChain, Classes/FxChainPanel

DESCRIPTION::
A link::Classes/FxChainPanel:: and the one-line footer every effect window has: the
hint at the left, the chain at the right ("bus 0 · 2 ch · 2 effects · on"). What
code::chain.gui:: opens. 1000 wide, and as tall as the tallest of its effects' own
windows with the chain's two rows on top (600 at the least).

code::
FxChain.master.gui;
::

